OL,3,AAnthropic shares fall a day after
OL,4,Ablockbuster opening
OL,5,
OL,6,FHowever, Anthropic's shares fell on
OL,7,FFriday, dropping more than 10% to about
OL,8,F$87.30, close to its IPO price of $83,
OL,9,Fand the broader stock market declines
OL,10,Fseen on Thursday continued.
OL,12,FThe tech-heavy Nasdaq Composite Index
OL,13,Ffell 2.8% in morning trade, the S&P 500
OL,14,Fwas down 1.2% while the Dow Jones
OL,15,FIndustrial Average remained largely
OL,16,Fflat.
